<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Nov '96 unemployment 835.564 vs 839.855.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Nov '96 unemployment 835.564 vs 839.855.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV UNEMPLOYMENT    NOV		OCT	    NOV 1995</p>
<p> number seeking work    835.564	  839.855	   783.229</p>
<p> vacancies		   29.131	   34.979	    19.668</p>
<p> total employed	  2.06 million	 2.06 million	  2.09 million</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data do not include private sector. Data cover Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom ++381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
